       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Drain septal hematoma right away"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " to prevent cartilage necrosis (saddle nose)"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
